Table full name: bigquery-public-data.hud_zipcode_crosswalk.zipcode_to_census_tracts
Column name: zip_code Type: STRING Description: 5 digit USPS Zip Code.
Column name: census_tract_geoid Type: STRING Description: 11 digit unique 2000 or 2010 Census tract GEOID consisting of state FIPS + county FIPS + tract code. The decimal is implied and leading and trailing zeros have been preserved. These can map to multiple USPS ZIPs. Maps to 'geo_id' in tables with Census Tract data
Column name: residential_ratio Type: NUMERIC Description: The ratio of residential addresses in the ZIP – Tract part to the total number of residential addresses in the entire ZIP.
Column name: business_ratio Type: NUMERIC Description: 	The ratio of business addresses in the ZIP – Tractpart to the total number of business addresses in the entire ZIP.
Column name: other_ratio Type: NUMERIC Description: The ratio of other addresses in the ZIP – Tractpart to the total number of business addresses in the entire ZIP.
Column name: total_ratio Type: NUMERIC Description: The ratio of all addresses in the ZIP – Tractpart to the total number of business addresses in the entire ZIP.
